## Haldane/s Rule
▪ Could change your probability when conditions
are X-linked recessive lethal
  - Ex. DMD
▪ When there is an isolated case in a male, the
probability that it is de novo is ⅓, inherited is ⅔.
▪ Cannot be used if more than one affected person
in the family
▪ Only applies when affected males cannot
reproduce due to lethality

